OL,3,GNEWSABomb threats and assaults lead to
OL,4,Adispersal orders
OL,5,
OL,6,FBomb threats, assaults and criminal
OL,7,Fdamage have led to dispersal orders
OL,8,Fbeing issued in two Lincolnshire towns.
OL,10,FLincolnshire Police said 22 young
OL,11,Fpeople had been identified as suspects
OL,12,Fassociated with reported anti-social
OL,13,Fbehaviour in Sutton Bridge and
OL,14,FHolbeach.
OL,16,FBoth orders will run from 19:00 on
OL,17,FFriday 23 October BST to 19:00 GMT on
OL,18,FSunday 25 October.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
